[size=5][b]What is a Happy Jump?[/b][/size]

A [b]Happy Jump[/b] is the cleanest way to push your stats: take [b]4 Xanax[/b], watch [b]5 Erotic DVDs[/b], pop [b]1 Ecstasy[/b], and rake in the gains. The catch in Torn? One bad roll on any of those steps and the whole run is gone — pills, DVDs, money, all of it.

[b]Not anymore.[/b] Every package I sell comes with [color=#e44][b]full OD insurance built in[/b][/color]. You jump, I cover the splat.

[hr]

[size=5][b]The Insurance — In Plain Numbers[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]Xanax OD[/b] (any of the 4 pills) → I send you back [b]4× Xanax[/b] + a [b]$1,000,000 rehab bonus[/b]
[*][b]Ecstasy OD[/b] → I send you a [b]full replacement package[/b] (4 Xan + 5 EDVD + 1 Ecstasy) + a [b]$1,000,000 rehab bonus[/b]
[*][b]Clean run[/b] → you keep everything, no clawback, no fine print
[/list]

Real OD probabilities on the package:
[list]
[*]P(Xanax OD across 4 pills) = [b]~11.47%[/b]
[*]P(Ecstasy OD after surviving Xanax) = [b]~4.43%[/b]
[/list]

That's roughly [b]1 in 6 jumps[/b] where the insurance actually pays out. I eat that cost so you don't have to.

[hr]

[size=5][b]Why Buy From Happy Jump Instead of Sourcing Yourself?[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]No bag-holding.[/b] You don't front cash for drugs that might OD into thin air.
[*][b]Live market pricing.[/b] Package price tracks the real Torn item market in real time — no markup-by-vibes.
[*][b]Transparent payout math.[/b] All formulas are public on the site. You can verify every number before you buy.
[*][b]Public availability counter.[/b] The site shows exactly how many insured packages I can cover [i]right now[/i] based on my reserve. If it says you can buy, the payout is fully funded — guaranteed.
[*][b]Searchable trade subjects.[/b] Payouts go out as [i]"HappyJump Payout - Xanax OD"[/i] or [i]"HappyJump Payout - Ecstasy OD"[/i] so your trade log is auditable.
[/list]

