[size=5][b]How It Works[/b][/size]

[list=1]
[*]Hit [url=https://happyjump.girovagabondo.com]happyjump.girovagabondo.com[/url]
[*]Drop in your Torn API key (validated through the official Torn API — I never see or store it in plain text)
[*]Confirm the package — price snapshots the moment you buy, so mid-week market swings can't bite you
[*]I send the package via in-game trade, your 3-day window starts
[*]Jump it. If you OD, mark it on the dashboard and the payout fires.
[*]If you make it through clean, the transaction auto-closes after 3 days.
[/list]

[hr]

[size=5][b]Security — Your API Key Is Safe[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Keys are encrypted with [b]AES-256-GCM[/b] server-side
[*]The browser only ever holds an opaque session token — [b]not[/b] your raw key
[*]Sign Out actually deletes the encrypted blob from the server (not just localStorage)
[*]5 bad token attempts and the row self-destructs — brute-force protection
[*]All Torn API calls are proxied through a Supabase Edge Function — keys [b]never[/b] touch the client
[/list]

If you can read code, the whole stack is open: [url=https://github.com/drumorgan/happyjump]github.com/drumorgan/happyjump[/url]

[hr]

[size=5][b]Bonus: Faction Drug-Use Events[/b][/size]

While you're on the site, check [b]/factionEvent[/b] — a free side tool for factions that want to run a [i]"who drank the most beer"[/i] or [i]"who burned the most cannabis"[/i] leaderboard inside a bounded window.

[list]
[*]Pick a drug, a start date, and a duration (default 48h, up to 30 days)
[*]Each participant gets the [b]full event duration[/b] anchored to their own personal start time — late joiners aren't punished
[*]Faction members are auto-added once they sign in once
[*]Self-healing leaderboard refreshes counts in the background — no spam-clicking
[*]Separate session from Happy Jump, separate API-key permissions ([i]basic, profile, log[/i] only)
[/list]

Just share the event link with your faction and let the counter run.

